### 1. Listar todos os clientes via Data API
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers
Accept: application/json

### 2. Buscar cliente especifico por ID (ID = 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Cadastrar novo cliente via POST
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Nova Empresa Delta SpA",
  "email": "contato@delta.com"
}

### 4. Consultar cliente recem-criado (ID = 4)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/customers/4
Accept: application/json
